See the file INDEX for a molecule index.

*****************************************************************
    From PDB, mol or mol2 files to easy execution of BOSS jobs     
*****************************************************************

See the scripts xPDBZ, xMOLZ and xMOL2Z. E.g.,

xPDBZ moleculename         (moleculename.pdb must exist)

This creates the files moleculename.z, plt.pdb and out.

After execution,
You could display the structure with, e.g., Rasmol:
x plt.pdb      

At this point, you could use many of the other scripts in the
boss/scripts directory to perform standard BOSS jobs on
moleculename.z.

See also 
xZCM1A moleculename   (moleculename.z must exist)
This script takes a BOSS Z-matrix and iteratively computes
CM1A charges and optimizes the strucutre until convergence.
It is used for creating a Z-matrix with CM1A charges
assigned for the OPLS/CM1A force field.
